    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"neighborhiding\"?? wait, so if they can sync through flashes, wouldn't a company be able to use that to send signal bursts to other devices or even just to mark when i'm active in a room? like, if the light pulses are acting as some kind of high-speed data burst to anything with a camera or sensor... that would explain why it's so precise. does that actually sound possible? like, could someone use light to leak data out of a house without it being caught by a standard firewall?",
